@title Learn home: Ctrl+K finds learning paths, no per-lesson Early access tag
@area Learn
# Creative round 25: "learning paths" found nothing; a level chip with no lessons was clickable and said
# "Try fewer words" (that is a unit test now, so the check does not depend on the catalog); every lesson carried an Early access tag.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text learning paths
wait 6
shot palette
expect "Learn"
key Enter
wait 30
shot learn-home
expect "Learn KoperCAD"
expect "Lessons are early access"
expect_not "· Early access"
check_layout
# Starting a lesson: the page must stay in view (round 25 saw a black band at the left).
click_text Start
wait 60
shot lesson-running
check_layout
